{"id": "t083-002", "text": "Lwazi has a second interview at the bank on 2 November 2026. He said the first round was mostly technical. His partner Amy is hoping he gets it so they can move closer to her parents. Wish him luck the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lwazi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second interview at the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Wish him luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t083-005", "text": "Rohan and Deepa's twins sit their GCSEs over the summer. Deepa says Aidan is fine but his sister is really struggling with maths and won't let anyone help. Rohan wants a tutor. Should check in with Deepa in a couple of weeks.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Deepa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "GCSEs", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Deepa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p4"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling with maths", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with Deepa", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Deepa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a couple of weeks", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t083-006", "text": "Mateo is applying for the head of design role at his place, deadline 14 November. He's not sure he wants the management side. His wife Ilse thinks he should go for it. Ask him whether he sent it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mateo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applying for the head of design role at his place", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sure he wants the management side", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ilse", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him whether he sent it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t083-008", "text": "Zeynep's little one, Kemal, lost his first tooth today and wrote the tooth fairy a letter. She's starting her MSc in January.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "little one", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost his first tooth", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MSc", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t083-010", "text": "Talked to Antoine after five a side. His interview at the council got pushed to sometime next week because the panel lead is off sick. He's been prepping every night and sounds pretty wound up about it. His girlfriend Petra is a teacher at the same primary as Rebecca, small world.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Antoine", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d0", "type": "DATE", "text": "after five a side"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the council", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty wound up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "teacher", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rebecca", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t083-012", "text": "Erin mentioned her dad retires on 30 November 2026 after 32 years on the buses. They're throwing him a party at the social club the weekend after. She said he'd love a decent fishing reel, the old one's falling apart.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Erin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retires", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "30 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "32 years on the buses", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party at the social club", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a decent fishing reel", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t083-014", "text": "Jun called. Saanvi's starting secondary in September and they still haven't heard back about the appeal. She's anxious about not being with her friends. Jun's working from home most days now. Call him end of next week to see if there's news.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saanvi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "secondary", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appeal", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious about not being with her friends", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "working from home most days", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t083-015", "text": "Long catch up with Katarzyna. She's applied for three jobs since the redundancy, one at Nowak & Brennan looked promising and they want to see her early March. Money's tight but she says she's okay. Her son Pedro got into the county rugby squad which has cheered everyone up. Her mum's moving in with them over the summer to help out. I said I'd send her the contact for the recruiter Zhang used. Need to actually do that tonight.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Katarzyna", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "one at Nowak & Brennan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early March", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Money's tight", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "okay", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the county rugby squad", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving in with them", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her the contact for the recruiter Zhang used", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "recruiter", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zhang", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t083-019", "text": "Spoke to Ahmed. His wife Saanvi is expecting, due early May. They're keeping it quiet until the 12 week scan next month. Ahmed is vegetarian now, keep in mind for dinner.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saanvi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early May", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "12 week scan", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t083-020", "text": "Luca's sister Chloe is doing her bar exams in February 2027 and has basically moved into the library. He's worried she's burning out. Must ask him how she's doing at some point next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chloe", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bar exams", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in February 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried she's burning out", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how she's doing", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "some point next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t083-022", "text": "Oscar's wedding anniversary is 18 November, 25 years. He wants to surprise his wife with a weekend in Edinburgh. Remind me to ask him if he booked it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oscar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "18 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "25 years", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "weekend in Edinburgh", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him if he booked it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t083-024", "text": "Mateo's interview is now cancelled, they gave it to an internal candidate. He's gutted but already looking elsewhere. His eldest, Luca, starts nursery after half term.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mateo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gave it to an internal candidate", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "looking elsewhere", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after half term", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t083-029", "text": "Grabbed lunch with Kemal and his brother Haruto. Kemal's been offered a place on the graduate scheme at Thomas Barros, starting September 2027. Haruto is still looking, he's had two interviews this month and hasn't heard back from either. He's trying to stay positive but you can tell it's getting to him. Kemal says their mum keeps asking Haruto about it at dinner which doesn't help. Message Haruto at the weekend, no job talk, just see if he wants to go climbing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offered a place", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduate scheme at Thomas Barros", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "looking", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "two interviews", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this month", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to stay positive", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "getting to him", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Message Haruto", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "climbing", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t083-032", "text": "Saw Pedro and his partner Erin at the market. They're getting married in Portugal, sometime in June 2027, invites going out early in the new year. Erin's brother Noah is doing the speech. Pedro still at the garage.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Erin", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Portugal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in June 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "early in the new year"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Erin", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the garage", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t083-034", "text": "Lwazi didn't get the bank job. He's taking it okay, says the feedback was useful. Amy and him are looking at houses anyway. Call him this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lwazi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "didn't get the bank job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "okay", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "looking at houses", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t083-039", "text": "Aidan came by. Just finished his first term at Bristol, loves it, joined the climbing club. He's thinking of switching to physics. Rohan doesn't know yet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first term at Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "loves it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "climbing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking of switching to physics", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t083-046", "text": "Chat with Ahmed, he's leaving his job end of the month to go freelance. His boss tried to talk him out of it. His wife thinks it's the right move. Leaving drinks probably the Friday before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving his job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "go freelance", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Friday before", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t083-050", "text": "Talked to Jun about Saanvi. They won the appeal, she's going to Hillcrest with her friends in September 2027. Jun was over the moon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jun", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saanvi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "won the appeal", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Hillcrest", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jun", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t083-053", "text": "Spoke to Ilse about her sister Krisztina. Krisztina got the uni job and starts 1 February 2027, but has to move to Manchester for it. She's excited but sad about leaving her flat. Ilse says Krisztina's partner might follow over the summer if his transfer goes through. Remind me to ask Krisztina when her leaving do is.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ilse", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Krisztina", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Krisztina", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got the uni job", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "1 February 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move to Manchester", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sad about leaving her flat", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ilse", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Krisztina", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "follow", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "transfer", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Krisztina when her leaving do is", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e6", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Krisztina", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e6", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t083-055", "text": "Lwazi says Amy's interview result came through and she got it! Starting 2 November 2026. They're celebrating Saturday at their place.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lwazi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview result", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Starting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November 2026", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "celebrating", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t083-056", "text": "Kalani mentioned Jun passed his piano exam with merit. Also her husband finished the treehouse, finally.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "piano exam", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "finished the treehouse", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}]}
{"id": "t083-059", "text": "Haruto finally got a job offer! Junior analyst at a startup, starts the week after next. He said he nearly turned it down because of the commute. Kemal is buying the first round Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job offer", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Junior analyst at a startup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after next", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first round", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
